# SEO keywords — never translate

Primary search terms and brand phrases stay **English on all locales** (`/es/`, `/ar/`, etc.), including `<title>`, meta description, and home **H1** (`hero.titleLine1`).

## Do not localize

- `FC 27 cheats`, `FC27 Cheats`, `fc 27 cheats`, `fc27 mod menu`, `FC27 mod menu`
- `HWID spoofer`, `HWID Spoofer`, `mod menu`, `loader`
- `EA Javelin`, `EA SPORTS FC 27`, `Ultimate Team`, `Career Mode`, `Pro Clubs`
- `Windows PC`, `cheatsfc27.org`, product names and menu toggle labels

UI body copy, nav labels, and paragraphs **may** translate; SEO surfaces above must not swap cheats/trucos/triches/شفرات for the English money terms.

## Files

- **Canonical SEO:** `src/i18n/seo/en.json` — non-English `src/i18n/seo/{locale}.json` must use the **same** `site.title` and `pages.*.title` as EN (run `node scripts/sync-seo-from-en.mjs` after EN edits).
- **Hints:** `scripts/locale-seo-keywords.json` — `homePrimary` is always `FC 27 cheats` (English).
- **Translate:** `scripts/translate.mjs` `seoPrompt` — titles copied verbatim from English; descriptions keep protected terms via `gemini-protect` + `src/i18n/glossary.json`.

## Home H1

`hero.titleLine1` in every `src/i18n/{locale}.json` must match English:

`FC 27 Cheats for Windows PC — mod menu and pricing`

## Before ship

```powershell
node scripts/sync-seo-from-en.mjs
npm run check:seo
npm run verify
```
